    GrapeLu - Murder Mystery 2
    Features: Role ESP, Coin Collector, Auto Grab Gun, Speed / Jump / Noclip
    UI: dark tabbed, draggable, works on mobile executors
    RightShift (PC) shows / hides the menu.
]]

local env = (getgenv and getgenv()) or _G

